## ADG Standards

This project follows AI Development Group (ADG) conventions:

- **Python >=3.11** — modern type hints, `match` statements
- **src/ layout** — clean import paths, no import confusion
- **Separation of concerns** — agents, tools, and workflows are first-class directories
- **Pydantic config** — type-safe settings from environment variables
- **Agent-ready** — structured for AI-assisted development workflows

